WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.491
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind steps in data collection.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:11.339
Research question: states what we want to discover. Sample: is a smaller selected

00:00:11.339 --> 00:00:11.721
group.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:17.957
Consent: means someone agrees to participate. Tally: records counts using marks.

00:00:17.957 --> 00:00:21.408
Conclusion: explains what the collected results suggest.

00:00:22.283 --> 00:00:27.368
Collect a few harmless facts about classroom materials, NOT personal details. Make a

00:00:27.368 --> 00:00:32.452
paper chart with the terms Research question, Sample and Consent; explain what each

00:00:32.452 --> 00:00:32.843
means.
